OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to couple killed in
OL,4,AA358 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid by the family
OL,7,Fof a couple who died in a road
OL,8,Fcollision.
OL,10,FKaren Cozens, 60, and David Cozens, 52,
OL,11,Ffrom Minehead, died when their Mazda
OL,12,Fvan was involved in a collision with a
OL,13,Florry on the A358 in Combe Florey, near
OL,14,FTaunton, Somerset, at 06:40 BST on 30
OL,15,FSeptember.
OL,17,FIn a statement, Karen's family
OL,18,Fdescribed the couple as "loved by their
OL,19,Ffamily and by everyone around them".
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
