OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to couple killed in
OL,4,AA358 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid's son Matthew said his father
OL,7,Falways "put everyone first" and was
OL,8,Falways there when needed. "He was the
OL,9,Fpatriarch of our family and always so
OL,10,Fproud of his children and
OL,11,Fgrandchildren," he said.
